developer Hidden Path Entertainment, Hypercade includes four arcade games, each with its own unique take on fan favorites of yesteryear.    \n\nDodge dive-bombing aliens in Space Swarm, a classic vertical shooter featuring waves of unique enemy flight formations and challenging special bonus stages.  Evade the onslaught of multi-legged creatures in Crazy Critters, but beware - shoot them in the middle and they'll divide in half!  Save humanity from homicidal robots in Robo Rush, a classic twin-stick shooter featuring a unique hands-free mode. Maneuver your paddle with a glance as you deflect a bouncing crystal to smash through walls of gems and collect special power-ups in Breaker Blaster.\n\nGet Hypercade now!\n", "short_description": "Hypercade brings a modern spin to nostalgic arcade action in VR, with simple to use controls paired with classic arcade challenge.\n\nPlay four incredible arcade classics completely hands free or with a controller.  Brought to you by acclaimed VR game developer Hidden Path Entertainment, Hypercade includes four arcade games, each with its own unique take on fan favorites of yesteryear.    "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://hiddenpath.com/privacy.php", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://hiddenpath.com/terms.php", "publisher_name": "Hidden Path Entertainment", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://www.hiddenpath.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": null, "genres": ["ACTION", "ARCADE"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["GAMEPAD", "TOUCHPAD"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id"